  "body": "## What changed\nAdded a default-suite test (`the_3d_finish_band_split_levels_move_within_stepdown_and_links_cross_edge`) and helpers (`milling_test_finish_band`, `flat_feed_zs`) in `crates/app/tests/shared_face_bodies_finish.rs`.\nThe test runs 3D Finish (`BN-0600`, kind defaults) on `Milling-test.step` across `[20.0, 18.0]`, `[18.0, 16.0]`, and the whole span `[20.0, 16.0]`.\nIt checks verification gates, zero gouge cells, band-edge Z shifts within `scallop_stepdown`, and the clearance `Rapid` + `Plunge` link across `edge_z = 18.0`.\nAdded `docs/decisions/1853-finish-band-edge-links.md`.\n\n## Cause\nPR #1846 split the heavy `sample_ap214.step` 3D Finish test into six Z bands.\nThat split pinned band boundaries to each band edge and left cross-band link generation and near-edge level shifts untested.\nProduction 3D Finish code already handles both; only the test was missing.\n\n## Tests\n- Pin: `the_3d_finish_band_split_levels_move_within_stepdown_and_links_cross_edge` in `crates/app/tests/shared_face_bodies_finish.rs` passes on `upstream/main` (`2 passed; 0 failed; 6 ignored` in 6.75s) because #1853 only asks for the missing test.\n- Temporary mutation 1 (`crates/motion/src/finishing3d/ladder.rs` line 157, stepping by `1.5 * dz`, reverted): the pin failed (`z_above=18.838104996137776 stepdown=0.7745966692414834`) and passed again after restoring.\n- Temporary mutation 2 (`crates/motion/src/finishing3d/rings.rs` lines 414-420, dropping clearance `Rapid` retract/traverse between Z levels, reverted): the pin failed (`gouge: program cuts below the model in 9 cell(s), worst 0.19 mm at (0.44, -29.94, z 19.81)`) and passed again after restoring.\n- Quick gate (`gate quick --base upstream/main`, run with `RUSTC_WRAPPER` unset and `CAMCRAFT_NO_SCCACHE=1` due to host `sccache` permission errors): green (`app suites`, `1 step(s), 0 failed`, 6s).\n- Clippy (`cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`, run with `RUSTC_WRAPPER` unset): green (0 warnings).\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\nThe six ignored heavy-lane `sample_ap214.step` band tests and the full release gate did not run.\n\n## Overlaps\nPR #2058 edits lines 3-11 (module doc comment) in `crates/app/tests/shared_face_bodies_finish.rs`.\nTouches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #1853\n",
